# Testing

<!-- Generated from AGENTS.md and .agents sources. Keep canonical updates there first. -->

Add or update focused tests when behavior changes. Use regression tests for bug fixes and contract tests for API shape changes.

Actual commands:
- `npm run lint`
- `npm run typecheck`
- `npm run test`
- `npm run build`
- `npm run test:e2e --workspace frontend`

Do not claim a check passed unless it actually ran. If a check is skipped, state why.
